<h4>The team Second Brain — the real problem is not the tool</h4>
<p>Once your own brain feels familiar, the next question arrives. <strong>"How do I merge it with my teammates'?"</strong> People usually agonize over <em>"Google Drive or Notion or GitHub"</em>, but the real hard part is <strong>not the tool — it is habits and change management</strong>.</p>

